      "text": "Focused on pipeline architecture (Master.R), bunching estimation calls and thresholds, DIB specification, moral hazard DID model, and structural model initialization. Skipped robustness checks, heterogeneity analysis, and complete structural model details due to budget constraints. Renv and stargazer packages are vendored dependencies.",
