      "kind": "reading_note",
      "text": "Analysis at deal-location level (winner vs runner-up/alternatives). Reduced-form specifications use reghdfe with year FE. Structural models use MLE with random coefficients estimated separately for manufacturing and trade/services. Counterfactual analysis simulates location choices under different subsidy scenarios.",
